{"seq":1,"slug":"idempotent-receiver","title":"幂等接收器设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/idempotent-receiver","wordCount":1363,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"幂等接收器设计\">幂等接收器设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>At-least-once 投递语义使重复事件成为必然——幂等接收器通过 event-id 去重和业务级幂等设计确保重复处理不产生副作用。本文覆盖基于 Event ID 的去重、存储选型与 TTL 策略、投递级 vs 业务级幂等、并发竞态处理、乱序事件策略、以及去重窗口与存储成本的权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么消费者必须处理重复\">为什么消费者必须处理重复</h2><p>At-least-once 投递语义意味着消费者<strong>一定</strong>会收到重复事件。这不是偶发情况，而是正常运行的必然结果。重复的来源包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provider 发送成功但未收到响应，触发重试</li>\n<li>Provider 内部重试队列的消息重复消费</li>\n<li>网络分区恢复后的积压重发</li>\n<li>消费者返回 200 但 provider 在记录前崩溃</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个处理支付的 webhook 接收器如果不具备幂等性，重复的 <code>payment.completed</code> 事件可能导致二次扣款或重复发货。幂等性不是优化——它是 webhook 消费者的<strong>正确性要求</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于-event-id-的去重\">基于 Event ID 的去重</h2><p>Standard Webhooks 规范通过 <code>webhook-id</code> 头为每个投递提供唯一标识。消费者在处理前检查该 ID 是否已处理过：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as Provider&#10;    participant C as 消费者端点&#10;    participant DB as 幂等存储&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C: POST (webhook-id: evt_abc)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;DB: EXISTS evt_abc?&#10;    alt 首次接收&#10;        DB--&gt;&gt;C: false&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;C: 处理业务逻辑&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;DB: STORE evt_abc (TTL=7d)&#10;        C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK&#10;    else 重复接收&#10;        DB--&gt;&gt;C: true&#10;        C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK (跳过处理)&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as Provider\n    participant C as 消费者端点\n    participant DB as 幂等存储\n    P-&gt;&gt;C: POST (webhook-id: evt_abc)\n    C-&gt;&gt;DB: EXISTS evt_abc?\n    alt 首次接收\n        DB--&gt;&gt;C: false\n        C-&gt;&gt;C: 处理业务逻辑\n        C-&gt;&gt;DB: STORE evt_abc (TTL=7d)\n        C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK\n    else 重复接收\n        DB--&gt;&gt;C: true\n        C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK (跳过处理)\n    end</pre><p>关键实现细节：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储时机</td>\n<td>业务处理完成后写入</td>\n<td>处理失败不会阻止后续重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储介质</td>\n<td>Redis SET 或数据库唯一索引</td>\n<td>Redis 快但需持久化；DB 可靠但慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTL</td>\n<td>7-30 天</td>\n<td>平衡存储成本和去重窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key 格式</td>\n<td><code>{endpoint_id}:{event_id}</code></td>\n<td>多端点场景避免误去重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"存储选型与-ttl-策略\">存储选型与 TTL 策略</h2><p>去重存储的选择取决于事件量和一致性要求：</p>\n<h3 id=\"redis-set-ttl\">Redis SET + TTL</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SADD processed_events:{endpoint_id} {event_id}&#10;EXPIRE processed_events:{endpoint_id} 604800  // 7 天\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SADD processed_events:{endpoint_id} {event_id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPIRE processed_events:{endpoint_id} 604800  // 7 天</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：O(1) 查询，适合高频场景。劣势：Redis 重启可能丢失数据（需开启 AOF 持久化）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据库唯一约束\">数据库唯一约束</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE processed_events (&#10;  endpoint_id UUID NOT NULL,&#10;  event_id    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  processed_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (endpoint_id, event_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 定期清理&#10;DELETE FROM processed_events&#10;WHERE processed_at &lt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processed_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  endpoint_id UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (endpoint_id, event_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 定期清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：强一致，与业务事务可在同一数据库中原子化。劣势：大量写入时需要分区。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bloom-filter-概率去重\">Bloom Filter（概率去重）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>误判</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{误判}) = \\left(1 - e^{-kn/m}\\right)^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">误判</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.039em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.389em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为哈希函数数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为已插入元素数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为比特数组大小。Bloom filter 的误判（false positive）只会导致跳过新事件不处理，需要配合精确查询作为第二层检查。适用于每日百万级事件的初步过滤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"业务级幂等-vs-投递级去重\">业务级幂等 vs 投递级去重</h2><p>事件去重只解决了「识别重复」的问题，但业务层面的幂等需要更深的设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>投递级去重</td>\n<td>同一事件 ID 不处理两次</td>\n<td>Event ID 存储 + 检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务级幂等</td>\n<td>同一业务操作不执行两次</td>\n<td>幂等键 + 状态机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>举例：<code>invoice.paid</code> 事件携带 <code>invoice_id</code>。即使两个不同的 event_id 都表示同一发票的支付完成（极端情况：provider 生成了重复事件），业务层也应检查发票是否已标记为 paid：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function handleInvoicePaid(event) {&#10;  const { invoice_id, amount } = event.data;&#10;&#10;  // 业务级幂等检查&#10;  const invoice = await db.invoices.findById(invoice_id);&#10;  if (invoice.status === &#39;paid&#39;) {&#10;    return; // 已处理，安全跳过&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 使用乐观锁防止并发重复处理&#10;  const updated = await db.invoices.updateOne(&#10;    { id: invoice_id, status: &#39;pending&#39; },&#10;    { status: &#39;paid&#39;, paid_at: new Date() },&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  if (updated.modifiedCount === 0) {&#10;    return; // 并发处理已完成&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  await creditAccount(invoice.customer_id, amount);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleInvoicePaid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">invoice_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 业务级幂等检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> invoice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.invoices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(invoice_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (invoice.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 已处理，安全跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 使用乐观锁防止并发重复处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> updated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.invoices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updateOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { id: invoice_id, status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, paid_at: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (updated.modifiedCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 并发处理已完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> creditAccount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(invoice.customer_id, amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"幂等与并发-竞态条件处理\">幂等与并发：竞态条件处理</h2><p>两个相同事件的投递请求可能在毫秒级间隔内同时到达。单纯的「先查后写」存在竞态窗口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"时间线：&#10;  T1: 请求 A 查询 → 未处理&#10;  T2: 请求 B 查询 → 未处理&#10;  T3: 请求 A 处理 + 写入标记&#10;  T4: 请求 B 处理 + 写入标记（重复！）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>时间线：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  T1: 请求 A 查询 → 未处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  T2: 请求 B 查询 → 未处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  T3: 请求 A 处理 + 写入标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  T4: 请求 B 处理 + 写入标记（重复！）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决方案：</p>\n<p><strong>数据库唯一约束 + 异常捕获</strong>——INSERT 时依赖唯一键约束，捕获 duplicate key 错误视为重复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO processed_events (endpoint_id, event_id)&#10;VALUES ($1, $2)&#10;ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING&#10;RETURNING *;&#10;-- 返回空 = 已存在 = 重复\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processed_events (endpoint_id, event_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT DO NOTHING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回空 = 已存在 = 重复</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Redis SETNX 原子操作</strong>——SET if Not eXists 保证原子性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SET event:{id} &quot;processing&quot; NX EX 300&#10;-- 返回 OK = 首次获取锁&#10;-- 返回 nil = 已被其他请求处理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SET event:{id} \"processing\" NX EX 300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 返回 OK = 首次获取锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 返回 nil = 已被其他请求处理</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"乱序事件的处理\">乱序事件的处理</h2><p>Webhook 不保证事件到达顺序。消费者可能先收到 <code>order.shipped</code> 再收到 <code>order.created</code>。处理策略取决于业务语义：</p>\n<p><strong>策略 1：基于版本号/时间戳的状态更新</strong></p>\n<p>只接受比当前已知状态更新的事件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE orders&#10;SET status = $new_status, updated_at = $event_time&#10;WHERE id = $order_id AND updated_at &lt; $event_time;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $new_status, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $event_time;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略 2：事件缓冲与重排</strong></p>\n<p>暂存乱序事件，等待前置事件到达后按序处理。复杂度高，通常只在强顺序依赖的场景使用。</p>\n<p><strong>策略 3：无序容忍设计</strong></p>\n<p>将每个事件设计为完全自描述——包含处理所需的全部上下文，不依赖历史状态。这是最健壮的设计，但要求 provider 在 payload 中提供充分的快照信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重窗口与存储成本权衡\">去重窗口与存储成本权衡</h2><p>去重窗口的长度是安全性和成本的权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>存储需求</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>事件速率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>TTL</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单条大小</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{存储需求} = \\text{事件速率} \\times \\text{TTL} \\times \\text{单条大小}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存储需求</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">事件速率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单条大小</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>假设每日接收 100 万事件，每条 event_id 占 64 字节，7 天 TTL：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext>B</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>448</mn><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{万} \\times 7 \\times 64\\text{B} = 448\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">448</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Redis 可轻松承载。若 TTL 延长到 90 天，增长到约 5.7 GB——仍在合理范围。</p>\n<p>实际的 TTL 应匹配 provider 的最大重试周期。如果 provider 在 72 小时后放弃重试，消费者的去重窗口至少需要覆盖 72 小时加安全余量。Standard Webhooks 推荐的重试周期约 33.5 小时，7 天的去重窗口提供了充足的安全边际。</p>\n<p>去重后的事件如何进入异步处理管道，参见 <a href=\"async-processing-queue\">异步处理与队列集成</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>幂等接收器是 webhook 消费者正确性的基石。投递级去重（基于 event-id + 存储检查）解决大部分重复问题，业务级幂等（乐观锁 + 状态检查）防御极端情况。并发竞态通过数据库唯一约束或 Redis SETNX 保证原子性。乱序事件的处理取决于业务语义——基于时间戳的条件更新是最通用的方案。去重窗口的 TTL 应覆盖 provider 最大重试周期加安全余量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"幂等接收器设计","id":"幂等接收器设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么消费者必须处理重复","id":"为什么消费者必须处理重复"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 Event ID 的去重","id":"基于-event-id-的去重"},{"level":2,"text":"存储选型与 TTL 策略","id":"存储选型与-ttl-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Redis SET + TTL","id":"redis-set-ttl"},{"level":3,"text":"数据库唯一约束","id":"数据库唯一约束"},{"level":3,"text":"Bloom Filter（概率去重）","id":"bloom-filter-概率去重"},{"level":2,"text":"业务级幂等 vs 投递级去重","id":"业务级幂等-vs-投递级去重"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等与并发：竞态条件处理","id":"幂等与并发-竞态条件处理"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序事件的处理","id":"乱序事件的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"去重窗口与存储成本权衡","id":"去重窗口与存储成本权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"限流与退避策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/rate-limiting-backoff"},"next":{"title":"异步处理与队列集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/consumer-side/async-processing-queue"}}